{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"container med post-content\">\n<figure class=\"img-border featured-image\">\n<img/>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple 喺今個月一口氣推出多款全新產品，包括新一代 AirPods 5 同埋 Beats 360 ANC 頭戴式耳機（發售優惠最後一日）、Apple Watch Series 12 同 Ultra 4，以及配備最新 M6 晶片嘅 Mac mini 同 Mac Studio。所有產品仲配襯咗一系列全新配件。</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Amazon 嘅初秋 Prime Day 大減價都將部分產品嘅發售優惠延續，想即刻入手嘅朋友可以參考，我哋已經幫你整理晒喺下面。</p>\n<span id=\"more-1072147\"></span>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-full\"><img/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-airpods-5\">AirPods 5</h2>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>AirPods 5（配備 ANC）$129</li>\n<li>AirPods 5（配備無線充電盒）$149</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-full\"><img/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-beats-360\">Beats 360</h2>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">***注意：今日係以 80 折優惠入手 Beats 360 Cushion Kit 嘅最後一日</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-full\"><img/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-apple-watch-series-12\">Apple Watch Series 12</h2>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-apple-watch-ultra-4\">Apple Watch Ultra 4</h2>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-apple-watch-se-3\">Apple Watch SE 3</h2>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-full\"><img/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-m6-mac-mini\">M6 Mac mini</h2>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-mac-studio\">Mac Studio</h2>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-2026-apple-watch-bands\">2026 年 Apple Watch 錶帶</h2>\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text\" style=\"grid-template-columns:20% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple Watch Alpine Loop，49mm，深橄欖色，自然鈦金屬，L $99</p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text\" style=\"grid-template-columns:20% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-me